      "created_at": "2014-05-26T00:53:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, but only by being fairly lucky: I was in Silver Gulch, so I was able to let Explosives Wagon-enhanced Sheriff Pratt and Tyler Hayes pound on the villain targets for me.  With Next Evolution, Legacy took and pinged all the melee damage being directed at the heroes with until his HP were whittled down to the point that Writhe was the guy blocking and/or countering all single hits (which took a while because he got out his ring and Motivational Charge within five rounds, so the group stayed pretty healthy), Mainstay kept the Sentinels running, and a bunch of Visionary’s Suggestion cards got to hand early on to keep control of the deck while frantically spamming Enlighten on Legacy to get Lead From the Front out.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
