      "cooked": "<p><i><a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0277213/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Capt. Malcolm Reynolds</a></i>: [<i>mocking Simon's seriousness</i>] Fear's nothing to be ashamed of, Doctor.<br><i><a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0536883/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Dr. Simon Tam</a></i>: This isn't fear. This is anger.<br><i><a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0277213/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Capt. Malcolm Reynolds</a></i>: Well, kinda hard to tell one from t'other, face like yours.<br><i><a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0536883/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Dr. Simon Tam</a></i>: Yes, well, I imagine if it were fear, my eyes would be wider.<br><i><a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0277213/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Capt. Malcolm Reynolds</a></i>: I'll look for that next time.</p>",
